'@@author Rixte
@startuml
!include readable.iuml
title Checking the current plan
participant "mishMash:MishMash" as App
participant "check:CheckShortfallCommand" as Check
participant "activePlan:ActiveMealPlan" as Active
participant "plan:MealPlan" as Plan
App -> Check : execute(recipeBook)
Check -> Active : get()
Active --> Check : optional plan
opt plan present
 Check -> Plan : getNumberOfDays()
 Plan --> Check : day count
end
alt absent plan or zero days
 Check --> App : generate-first message
else plan has days
 loop each day in order
  Check -> Plan : getDays()
  Plan --> Check : days
  note over Check : Select day = days.get(index).
  Check -> Check : findShortfalls(day)
  ref over Check, Plan : Daily comparison (separate diagram)
  Check -> Check : append day result
 end
 Check --> App : joined result lines
end

@enduml
'@@author
